    <!-- health -->
    <string name="default_privacy_policy_title">Health Data Access</string>
    <string name="default_privacy_policy_description">\nWe request access to your health data to provide personalized insights \nand support features that help you understand your activity, wellbeing, \nand overall health trends.\n\nHealth data accessed through Health Connect may include:\n• Activity information (steps, distance, exercise sessions)\n• Body measurements (weight, body fat, height)\n• Sleep data (sleep duration and patterns)\n• Nutrition and hydration information\n• Heart-related and vital signs data, when relevant to supported features\n\nWe only access the types of data you explicitly grant permission for.  \nYour data is used solely to enable in-app functionality such as progress \nvisualization, trend analysis, and personalized recommendations.\n\nYour health data remains on your device unless you choose to export or \nshare it. We do not sell your data, and we do not share it with third \nparties without your clear and explicit consent.\n\nFor more detailed information about how we handle your data, please \nreview our Privacy Policy.\n</string>
